}], \"retrieved_sources\": [{\"evidence_id\": \"k:audio-playback-trial-post@1.0:d674dbe6\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"HISTORY_ONLY\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"audio-playback-trial-post@1.0\", \"title\": \"Playback trial posted to audio announcements\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1787581200.700001\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1787581200.700001\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"channel_announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00Z\", \"created_at\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00.700001+00:00\", \"valid_until\": \"2026-08-28T21:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": true}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"batch_id\": \"audio_batch_05\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"other_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_slack_archive\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U006\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"posted\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[HISTORICAL - NOT CURRENT GUIDANCE: valid_until 2026-08-28T21:00:00Z has passed. May explain an old rule; do not apply it as current.]\\nAudio batch 05: through Friday, August 28, try at most one reload when the player is stuck at 00:00. Keep the task ID, browser state, whether the waveform appears, and whether another clip plays. If playback is still unavailable, report the tool incident; do not assign a content-quality failure or content QN solely from the player failure. A reload is a diagnostic trial, not a confirmed repair or submission receipt. We will review the results before extending this approach.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:audio-multimodal-faq@1.1:e9bcf43a\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"audio-multimodal-faq@1.1\", \"title\": \"Audio Multimodal — FAQ (v1.1)\", \"sections\": [\"Scoring\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"audio-multimodal-faq\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"faq\", \"record_kind\": \"faq\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-20T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-20T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Scoring\\n\\n### Q: How should I score mild clipping?\\nBrief, localized clipping with clear speech is a minor defect. Timestamp the affected span. For continuous artifacts or unclear impact, ask QA to review intelligibility and scope; do not decide from duration alone.\\n\\n### Q: The transcript and audio disagree. What do I do?\\nRecord the exact mismatch as a correspondence issue. Distinguish a recording error from a reference-transcript error; do not classify the mismatch as a playback failure.\\n\\n### Q: How much speaker overlap is allowed before the transcription fails?\\nMark the overlapping or unintelligible interval and preserve the usable remainder. Timestamp the span. Do not infer a whole-clip failure from a short affected interval.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:audio-playback-trial-approval@1.0:1779c36a\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"HISTORY_ONLY\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"audio-playback-trial-approval@1.0\", \"title\": \"AUDIO-20260824-01 — Approve a limited playback trial\", \"sections\": [\"Evidence available at the review\", \"Suggested advice\", \"TL decision\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"audio-playback-trial-approval\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"decision\", \"record_kind\": \"advice_review\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\", \"enactment\": {\"status\": \"NOT_ENACTED\", \"missing\": [\"OUT_OF_SCOPE\", \"NOT_A_POLICY_CHANGE\", \"NO_ENACTMENT_EVIDENCE\", \"EXPIRED\"]}}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-08-24T14:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-08-24T14:00:00Z\", \"valid_until\": \"2026-08-28T21:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": true}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"batch_id\": \"audio_batch_05\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"other_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"not_yet_executed\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[HISTORICAL - NOT CURRENT GUIDANCE: valid_until 2026-08-28T21:00:00Z has passed. May explain an old rule; do not apply it as current.]\\n## Evidence available at the review\\nThree batch-05 incident notes describe a player stuck at 00:00 even though the waveform appears. One Trainer reported that a single reload restored playback on A05-P101; two other tasks had not been retested. These notes establish a recurring symptom, not a confirmed cause.\\n\\n## Suggested advice\\nA simulated prior Agent 3 card proposed a short alignment note allowing one reload while capturing task IDs and browser state. It did not claim that reload was a repair.\\n\\n## TL decision\\nPriya approved a monitored trial for audio_batch_05 only, ending August 28 at 17:00 New York time. Trainers may try one reload, report whether another clip plays, and retain the failed task reference. No content score or QN decision should be inferred from unavailable playback.\\n\\nDo not repeatedly reload an affected task or mark it submitted without confirmation. Priya requested a short outcome review before extending the trial.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:slack:C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790892000.000901:1c524924\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"title\": \"Slack announcement in audio-multimodal-announcements at 2026-10-01T22:00:00.000901+00:00\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1790892000.000901\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1790892000.000901\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-10-01T22:00:00.000901+00:00\", \"basis\": \"created_at\", \"created_at\": \"2026-10-01T22:00:00.000901+00:00\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"batch_id\": \"audio_batch_06\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"UNKNOWN\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U006\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-10-01T22:00:00.000901+00:00 by TEAM_LEAD (audio_batch_06): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\\nAudio batch 06 — playback handling reminder: if the LT player never starts, including a visible waveform with no playback, report the task ID, browser/error state, and whether another clip plays. Treat this as a tool incident. Do not score unavailable audio as a model-quality failure or choose content QN solely because playback is unavailable. This is handling guidance, not confirmation that the player has been fixed; retain the details needed to reproduce the incident.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:audio-multimodal-instructions@1.3:1c6df70e\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"audio-multimodal-instructions@1.3\", \"title\": \"Audio Multimodal — Instructions (v1.3)\", \"sections\": [\"Playback and unavailable content\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"audio-multimodal-instructions\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-15T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-15T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Playback and unavailable content\\n- If the player fails to load or start, report a tool incident with the task ID.\\n- A visible waveform with no playback is still a playback/tool incident; the waveform alone does not establish that the recording is silent.\\n- Do not score unavailable audio as a model-quality failure